    "description": "What: CE-2476 / CE-2475 perception suite P2 (Sensing \u00a78.6e) - on bt-range a 'Red Shooter' in House A's west room (102,103) fires at a 'Blue Target' in the same room; four passive Blue listeners hear him from the east room (one inner wall, the hall door open beside it), outside the east window, south of the house and north of it - each by a different way (walls, the door, the window). Judge: the squad believes ONE enemy (matched 1, no duplicate) though every ear heard him by a different way; a hearing that came through an opening is a place to look (D-8), a straight one a place he is (CE-2479: a concrete inner wall costs a shot ~24 dB, so through the open hall door is the way). Fail: one shot is two enemies in the squad, or a straight hearing puts an enemy where none is. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh pe-house-shot"
